<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Xircom cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Xircom cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said it downgraded Xircom Inc to neutral from buy.  </p>
<p>-- Additional details not available.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 2-3/4 to 20-7/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
